mn represents the end of 2010, showing 21,241 for Canadian dollar liabilities. This suggests an increase from the 2009 year-end value of 17,694 to 21,241 at the end of 2010.\n\nI'll need to verify the trend by checking the 2012 bulletin for 2011 data to confirm this progression and understand the pattern of Canadian dollar liabilities.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_3ca98ba156bc4543a7ffa3cf","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_2012_03_page_58.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
